{"id":"9b00a411970a422e","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra.md","title":"ZFC Measure7 Completion Sigma Algebra","display":"df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure7 Completion Sigma Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra"],"display":"df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure7 Completion Sigma Algebra","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra — ZFC Measure7 Completion Sigma Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure\">../batch13/58-df-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\widehat{\\mathcal A}\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\widehat{\\mathcal A}\\in V\\)</span> (measure space and completion candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7CompletionSigmaAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7CompletionSigmaAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}completion\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7CompletionSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\widehat{\\mathcal A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\widehat{\\mathcal A}=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid\\exists A,C\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\subseteq B\\land B\\subseteq C\\land\\mu(C\\setminus A)=0)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}completion\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7CompletionSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\widehat{\\mathcal A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\widehat{\\mathcal A}=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid\\exists A,C\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\subseteq B\\land B\\subseteq C\\land\\mu(C\\setminus A)=0)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The measure predicate now carries its underlying set, and all sandwich witnesses are locally bound.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\widehat{\\mathcal A}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7CompletionSigmaAlgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure7\\text{-}completion\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7CompletionSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,\\widehat{\\mathcal A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\\land\\widehat{\\mathcal A}=\\{B\\subseteq X\\mid\\exists A,C\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\subseteq B\\land B\\subseteq C\\land\\mu(C\\setminus A)=0)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1112,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2623","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra.md|58-df-zfc-measure7-completion-sigma-algebra]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728"]}